title: Ghaf Tree-Crown Mapping from Area-Wide UAV Imagery
abstract: >-
  Semantic segmentation models and an area-wide inference pipeline for
  delineating Ghaf (Prosopis cineraria) tree crowns in UAV orthomosaics.
